  "description": "Love comes in when you least expect it… or does it? Falling for your best friend, your high school crush, your crush’s teammate, or even your bully... Wait that can’t be right! Can it? Well that’s the case for Melisa Neal, a shy aspiring artist that just came back to her hometown and her old childhood bully Trent Springs that seems intent on making amends. Are these intentional genuine or is he still the same person he’s always been? Follow these two along with their friends to see if love really does come out of nowhere or if it’s been right in front of your eyes all along.\nSource: Webtoon",
